  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Counter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"title\">\n    <h1 id=\"title\">Pixel Counter</h1>\n    <output id=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\">0</output>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"decrease\" aria-label=\"Decrease count by one\">−</button>\n      <button id=\"reset\" aria-label=\"Reset count to zero\">Reset</button>\n      <button id=\"increase\" aria-label=\"Increase count by one\">+</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1c2c;\n  --card: #2e2b44;\n  --accent: #ffcd75;\n  --text: #f4f4f4;\n  --shadow: #0f0f1a;\n}\n\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  border: 4px solid var(--accent);\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--shadow);\n  text-align: center;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 360px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  margin: 0 0 16px;\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n#count {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 4rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  margin: 16px 0 24px;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  line-height: 1;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  padding: 12px 20px;\n  min-width: 64px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--shadow);\n  transition: transform 0.05s, box-shadow 0.05s;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--bg);\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--text);\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(4px, 4px);\n  box-shadow: none;\n}\n\n[hidden] { display: none !important; }\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "let count = 0;\nconst output = document.getElementById('count');\nconst inc = document.getElementById('increase');\nconst dec = document.getElementById('decrease');\nconst res = document.getElementById('reset');\n\nfunction render() {\n  output.textContent = count;\n}\n\ninc.addEventListener('click', () => { count += 1; render(); });\ndec.addEventListener('click', () => { count -= 1; render(); });\nres.addEventListener('click', () => { count = 0; render(); });\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Counter\n\nA tiny offline pixel-style counter built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. No dependencies, no storage, no network requests.\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. The counter starts at 0.\n\n## Controls\n\n- **Increase (+)** — adds 1 (button id `increase`).\n- **Decrease (−)** — subtracts 1 (button id `decrease`).\n- **Reset** — sets the count back to 0 (button id `reset`).\n\nThe current value is shown in the output element with id `count`. Negative numbers are supported.\n\n## Accessibility\n\nAll buttons are real `<button>` elements with `aria-label` descriptions and visible focus styles. They can be activated with Tab + Enter/Space.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — markup\n- `style.css` — pixel-themed styling\n- `script.js` — counter logic\n",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
